Subject: [PATCH 094/159] drm/msm/mdss: Add SM7250 support

Same register bus vote as SM8250 (76.8 MB/s, the downstream mdss_reg
bus vote).

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
